<title>UK: UK 25-year gilt auction covered 1.73 times.</title>
<headline>UK 25-year gilt auction covered 1.73 times.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following result was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2021:</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 8.14 percent</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 1.73 times</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE: 98.08</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 32.5 percent</p>
<p>NOTES: The yield tail was two basis points, the price tail 6/32.</p>
<p>The stock will be fully paid and fungible with stock already in issue and will be strippable when strips facilities are introduced.</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
